-- =====================================================================
-- Caste and Sub Caste master data for Delhi (English + Hindi names).
-- SC = Delhi Scheduled Castes list; OBC and General = communities common in Delhi.
-- Check categories against the current official Delhi / Central lists before relying on them.
-- Import in phpMyAdmin (select your database > Import). Safe to run more than once:
-- existing castes / sub castes with the same name are left as they are.
-- Run AFTER the application has been opened once (it creates the castes / sub_castes tables),
-- or after db/upgrade-2026-11-castes.sql.
-- Caste is for survey entry and planning only: never guess caste from names, and appeals
-- on caste or religion are prohibited by law.
-- =====================================================================
